        &lt;Name&gt;Divya&lt;/Name&gt;
        &lt;Department&gt;Finance&lt;/Department&gt;
        &lt;Location&gt;Coimbatore&lt;/Location&gt;
        &lt;Salary&gt;50000&lt;/Salary&gt;
